      "text": "**Short answer:** Agentic AI is software in which a language model doesn't just generate a reply. It works towards a goal by deciding what to do next, calling tools (APIs, databases, code, search), observing the results and repeating until the task is done or a limit is reached. Generative AI produces content when asked. Agentic AI uses that same generative ability inside a loop of **plan → act → observe → adjust**, with guardrails around what it is allowed to do."
