      "type": "p",
      "text": "**5. Orchestration.** The control flow: a simple loop, a graph of steps with branches, or several agents with defined roles. Frameworks such as **LangGraph** model this as a state graph with explicit nodes and edges, which makes behaviour easier to test and debug than free-form loops ([LangGraph overview](https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langgraph/overview)). Our [LangGraph vs CrewAI vs AutoGen guide](/guides/langgraph-vs-crewai-vs-autogen) compares the main options."
