      "text": "**6. Tool connectivity standards.** The **Model Context Protocol (MCP)** is an open-source standard for connecting AI applications to external systems such as data sources, tools and workflows, so one integration can be reused across agents and clients ([MCP introduction](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/getting-started/intro))."
